  ],
  "description": "yamlprims specification revision 1.4, single-document entrypoints, strict flow indentation, merge directives rejected, with explicit limits (section 6). max_depth is 128. Every other limit is above the depth-boundary recipes, including the tree those inputs would build. S_127(0) and S_128(0) load. S_129(0) fails max_depth at the 129th bracket. Alias insertion at k = 125 and k = 126 loads. k = 127 stays within source level 128 and fails alias placement."
}
